  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0\n\n- Retargeted to .NET 8.\n- Replaced BlockingCollection/Task.Run pipeline implementation with System.Threading.Channels.\n- Added support for async pipeline steps (ValueTask-based) and configurable per-step parallelism.\n- Improved cancellation and disposal behavior (in-flight executions are canceled on dispose).\n- Expanded unit test coverage (async steps, cancellation, concurrency, async exceptions).",
